    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48447" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tĭtŭbantĭa</span></b> ,
			ae, f.
		titubo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a staggering</i>, <i>wavering</i>
			(very rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">linguae,</span>”
